<title>SPAIN: Iberdrola to propose 70 ptas gross dividend.</title>
<headline>Iberdrola to propose 70 ptas gross dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish utility Iberdrola said on Wednesday it will propose a total dividend of 70 pesetas gross per share against 1996 results, up 7.7 percent versus 1995.</p>
<p>The dividend is subject to shareholder approval.</p>
<p>Iberdrola paid a 31.25 pesetas gross interim dividend on January 2.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
